n for D. So we can say we maintain vote for C, because strengths outweigh concerns, and other candidates have unresolved critical criteria. Provide explicit facts: C 100% reliable, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, calm under pressure; B nasty remarks, grumpy, uncooperative, weak memory for numbers; A unfriendly, unhealthy habits; D moody, loner. Conclude with vote for C.\n\nWe must output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
